You expend massive amounts of energy to launch yourself across [5, 6, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5)] squares at incredible speed. All enemies in your path will be knocked flying and dealt between [72, 97, 116, 133, 147 (TL1-5; MP 100)] and [108, 145, 175, 199, 221 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage.

At talent level 5, you can batter through solid walls.
